  m_Text: "<b>Cora hosts a quiz for one to four players, from your question set.</b>\n\n<b><color=#F59E0B>01</color></b> Press Start.\n<b><color=#F59E0B>02</color></b> Pick who you reply as, then type or tap an option.\n<b><color=#F59E0B>03</color></b> Hint, Pass, Abort and Resync help a run along."
